# history.uis -- Verlauf (agent A2): pixel steps, undo / redo / jump, redo branch, layer
# structure, layer properties, document size, compound, cancel, unchanged edits, saved state,
# Verlauf löschen, one history per document, the Verlauf window (list, greyed redo rows,
# buttons), memory budget (deflate, spill file, dropping), out of memory.
# Test hooks: cmd 950..974 (hist_diag.s); probes "t.*" in the "Verlauf-Test" window.
# ids: list rows 196609 + i (ID_HIST_LIST 0x30000 + 1 + i), buttons 4101 Alles rückgängig,
# 4102 Rückgängig, 4103 Wiederholen, 4104 Vor bis zum Ende.

